Flide
-----
https://github.com/OmniJev/Flide (commit caffe660df88db747d6da9f95f7d6759fea38698)

Used in: crates/api/src/decision.rs (the limits and checks of the System One
request, flide/api/schema.py; how a chat model is asked a question and which
label tokens are read, flide/formats/next_token.py), crates/api/src/answer.rs
(the answers made from the labels' logits, flide/api/answers.py and
NextToken.finish), crates/api/src/python.rs (the state and the descriptions
written as Flide's Python writes them), crates/server/src/systemone.rs (the
request, response and errors of POST /v1/systemone, flide/api/schema.py and
flide/api/server.py), and the decisions of crates/runtime (a request's
questions forked from their shared start, read at the first token of the
reply, flide/formats/next_token.py and flide/runtime).

